NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000191 "Please report any bugs or feature requests through the issue tracker"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000192 "at L<https://github.com/dagolden/Test-FailWarnings/issues>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000193 "You will be notified automatically of any progress on your issue."
